Save Preset icon

Source: user-supplied SVG, preserved in data/icons/sources/save-preset.svg.
Bundled icon: data/icons/hicolor/scalable/actions/wallshader-save-preset-symbolic.svg

The original 24 × 24 viewBox and disk design are preserved.
The supplied filled outline has a 1.5-unit weight. A 1-unit round-join stroke
around its boundary increases the weight to the existing toolbar icon's 2.5 units.
That stroke is expanded and united with the original fill for native symbolic
recoloring on GTK 4.14 and later. The conversion uses Skia's getFillPath
(skia-python 144.0.post2, resScale 16) and union path operation, with conics converted
to quadratic curves at subdivision level 3 and six-decimal coordinates.
